  "description": "I used to call miang \"one-bite salad,\" but I'm rethinking it as it seems to suggest that you're supposed to wrap the whole thing up into a big bundle and eat it in one bite. Calling it \"salad cups\" doesn't do it either since a miang like this isn't usually served assembled in little lettuce cups. Either way, this shrimp and pomelo salad served with chili jam is simple, balanced, and delicious.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: shallots → ½ medium red onion; roasted cashews → peanuts",
